WEBVTT

00:47.881 --> 00:49.758
Was I being too loud?

01:13.156 --> 01:14.908
The light is weak.

01:14.991 --> 01:17.410
And it's unstable.

03:08.938 --> 03:10.273
It's still shaky.

03:11.357 --> 03:13.276
I didn't get to choose a pen

03:13.359 --> 03:15.028
that suits me in Kalhn.

03:15.111 --> 03:18.573
A LIGHT ON A RAINY DAY

03:21.367 --> 03:24.871
With pigment stones,
I could draw clean straight lines,

03:25.371 --> 03:29.209
but they don't work well
on small pieces of paper.

03:34.839 --> 03:36.341
Back then,

03:36.424 --> 03:38.801
there wasn't a single spell I could draw.

03:39.302 --> 03:40.595
The master said,

03:40.678 --> 03:43.306
ideas are important for magic too, but...

03:43.389 --> 03:46.017
Nope, nope! The more I think about it,
the worse I feel!

03:46.100 --> 03:48.228
I just have to get used to it!

03:48.311 --> 03:49.562
And practice lots!

03:49.646 --> 03:50.563
I'll do my best!

03:50.647 --> 03:52.398
Yeah!

03:57.487 --> 03:58.321
I'm sleepy.

04:06.537 --> 04:08.122
If you sleep here,

04:08.706 --> 04:09.916
you'll catch a cold.

04:13.086 --> 04:15.129
I wasn't planning on sleeping,

04:15.797 --> 04:17.382
but I suddenly felt sleepy.

04:17.465 --> 04:18.299
I see.

04:21.386 --> 04:25.223
At this rate,
I'll never clear the Tower of Tomes trial

04:25.306 --> 04:28.017
and find the picture book.

04:29.602 --> 04:31.688
There I go, thinking negative again!

04:32.397 --> 04:34.524
That's not it! I can do this!

04:34.607 --> 04:36.567
I really do love magic--

04:42.615 --> 04:44.659
Come with me for a minute.

04:48.746 --> 04:50.039
The kitchen.

04:51.249 --> 04:53.001
It smells so good.

04:54.168 --> 04:57.255
I was thinking of clearing the pots
around here soon.

05:00.633 --> 05:02.552
Here, have a taste.

05:10.310 --> 05:12.478
Mmm!

05:14.355 --> 05:16.983
Good, right?
I made this stew two years ago.

05:17.984 --> 05:20.903
The magic pot keeps rewinding
to the time when it was fresh,

05:20.987 --> 05:22.030
so it's still good.

05:22.613 --> 05:23.865
Don't worry.

05:24.532 --> 05:28.202
Still, the seal has to be redrawn
every so often,

05:28.286 --> 05:30.872
otherwise it won't last.

05:32.498 --> 05:33.916
A hard potato!

05:35.209 --> 05:37.253
These are delicious.

05:37.795 --> 05:40.506
Will you cook that potato for me?

05:41.966 --> 05:44.802
You can draw the Pyreball Seal now, right?

06:10.703 --> 06:12.080
Huh?

06:12.163 --> 06:15.666
The potato is heavy,
so make the levitation arrow longer.

06:19.629 --> 06:22.090
The flame can't be too weak or uneven.

06:25.468 --> 06:27.595
This time, the sigil was too big.

06:28.304 --> 06:30.181
Now, why don't you keep trying?

06:59.127 --> 07:00.837
It came out well this time!

07:00.920 --> 07:02.255
Wow!

07:05.091 --> 07:07.427
Yes, it's cooked perfectly.

07:09.595 --> 07:10.638
So, how about it?

07:11.264 --> 07:12.557
Still feel sleepy?

07:14.392 --> 07:15.810
You know,

07:16.477 --> 07:18.563
the first thing I got good at

07:18.646 --> 07:20.731
was water magic.

07:23.943 --> 07:26.404
Partly because I wasn't a good swimmer,

07:26.487 --> 07:28.614
but I didn't like getting wet.

07:29.365 --> 07:33.327
I'd practice all the time
to get out of doing dishes.

07:35.455 --> 07:37.331
If you feel that restless urgency

07:37.915 --> 07:39.834
and want to learn quickly,

07:40.626 --> 07:42.587
the best thing you can do is to make it

07:43.963 --> 07:44.964
a part of your life.

07:45.965 --> 07:49.218
There's no better teacher
than living itself.

07:52.972 --> 07:54.223
Make magic,

07:54.724 --> 07:56.142
a part of life...

07:56.726 --> 07:59.520
Cooking is great.
You get to practice, and it's delicious.

08:00.021 --> 08:01.898
- That's true!
- Hey!

08:01.981 --> 08:03.983
Thought I smelled something good.

08:04.066 --> 08:06.652
You're making something delicious!

08:06.736 --> 08:10.114
Okay! I'll melt the cheese!

08:10.198 --> 08:12.658
Adding sear with magic is so cool.

08:12.742 --> 08:14.410
Sorry, you two.

08:14.494 --> 08:16.662
I was thinking Coco can do it today.

08:17.413 --> 08:18.414
Is that okay?

08:19.415 --> 08:20.291
Yes!

08:42.146 --> 08:43.564
Finished!

08:43.648 --> 08:45.942
- Looks delicious!
- Looks delicious!

08:46.025 --> 08:49.362
I know! How about we eat outside?

08:49.445 --> 08:51.489
Great. It'll be like a picnic.

08:53.115 --> 08:55.451
Then I'll go get things ready.

08:56.536 --> 08:57.703
Oh, Agott!

08:57.787 --> 09:00.706
Agott, you should come too.
Let's have lunch outside!

09:00.790 --> 09:03.543
I'll eat while I work.

09:03.626 --> 09:05.002
I'll pass on eating outside.

09:05.545 --> 09:06.754
Besides...

09:09.006 --> 09:10.216
It's raining.

09:10.299 --> 09:14.262
Aww, it was sunny until a minute ago.

09:14.345 --> 09:15.471
It can't be helped.

09:15.555 --> 09:18.516
Master said he doesn't like getting wet.

09:18.599 --> 09:19.433
Girls.

09:20.309 --> 09:22.812
Why are you so disappointed?

09:27.316 --> 09:28.985
Whoa!

09:29.860 --> 09:32.989
We're witches, aren't we?

09:33.072 --> 09:36.492
Now, let's get our things and get going.

10:09.567 --> 10:10.401
Look.

10:11.027 --> 10:12.737
The rain clouds are clearing.

10:26.709 --> 10:29.295
You know, I'll go get Agott after all!

10:29.378 --> 10:30.671
I want us to see it together.

10:31.297 --> 10:32.965
The magic the sky showed us.

10:45.936 --> 10:47.647
Agott?

10:51.567 --> 10:53.361
Who are you?

10:53.444 --> 10:55.404
I don't recognize you.

10:55.905 --> 10:58.866
Are you someone's messenger? Alaira's?

11:00.701 --> 11:02.620
Oh, um, I'm--

11:04.580 --> 11:05.915
A storm is coming, so...

11:09.794 --> 11:13.422
I'm Master Qifrey's apprentice.

11:15.174 --> 11:16.133
What?

11:17.051 --> 11:18.552
Apprentice?

11:21.180 --> 11:24.058
Hey, Olruggio. You're done with work?

11:24.141 --> 11:25.518
I thought it'd take more--

11:25.601 --> 11:28.104
How did you end up
with another apprentice?

11:28.187 --> 11:30.147
There's an explanation for this.

11:30.231 --> 11:32.942
She's a victim of forbidden magic--

11:33.025 --> 11:34.485
Forbidden magic?

11:36.987 --> 11:37.947
Come.

11:42.493 --> 11:44.662
I'm not getting involved
with the Brimmed Caps.

11:45.579 --> 11:47.581
I'm handing her over
to the Knights Moralis.

11:48.416 --> 11:50.918
Wait, please! I--

11:58.926 --> 12:01.137
I won't let you take Coco.

12:01.804 --> 12:04.432
Even if you're my good friend.

12:06.142 --> 12:08.602
You'd even point magic at me over this?

12:08.686 --> 12:10.604
Just what is this girl?

12:12.523 --> 12:14.608
For now, let's go inside.

12:15.109 --> 12:16.944
I'll explain everything.

12:20.990 --> 12:23.826
I thought it'd let up
once the clouds broke,

12:23.909 --> 12:26.662
but the rain's gotten heavier.

12:28.456 --> 12:31.667
Whoa! Looks like it's gonna be
a rough night.

12:31.751 --> 12:32.668
Yeah...

12:33.502 --> 12:34.670
Definitely stormy.

12:35.880 --> 12:39.550
So you made an exception and took on
an Outsider as your apprentice?

12:40.342 --> 12:42.553
"Outsider" is rude.

12:43.137 --> 12:44.513
Her name is Coco.

12:44.597 --> 12:46.348
Sorry, Coco.

12:46.891 --> 12:50.895
There isn't another word
for anyone who isn't a witch.

12:52.229 --> 12:54.231
It's your first time meeting, right?

12:56.442 --> 12:57.860
This is Olruggio.

12:58.360 --> 13:00.738
He's the Watchful Eye of the atelier.

13:02.281 --> 13:04.366
Unlike Kalhn or the Great Hall,

13:04.450 --> 13:07.036
small ateliers on the outskirts like ours

13:07.119 --> 13:08.913
can get pretty isolated.

13:09.413 --> 13:13.417
So to keep problems from getting hidden,
another witch is assigned

13:13.501 --> 13:16.337
to stay here as a "Watchful Eye."

13:16.420 --> 13:19.965
Says the guy who was just hiding a problem

13:20.049 --> 13:22.051
like it was nothing.

13:23.552 --> 13:26.472
If I had erased Coco's memory that day,

13:26.972 --> 13:30.851
any lead for the picture book on
forbidden magic would have been lost.

13:30.935 --> 13:33.854
To turn her mother back to normal too,

13:33.938 --> 13:35.981
I felt this was the best option.

13:36.690 --> 13:38.234
Lead?

13:38.818 --> 13:42.488
It's not our job
to investigate forbidden magic.

13:43.197 --> 13:45.574
We should leave it to the Knights Moralis.

13:56.418 --> 13:59.004
"What's this Knights Moralis
they keep mentioning?"

13:59.797 --> 14:01.215
You've got that look.

14:02.216 --> 14:04.760
The Order of Moral Spell Casting,
a.k.a. "Knights Moralis."

14:05.261 --> 14:07.972
They follow the rules established
on the Day of the Pact.

14:08.055 --> 14:11.141
They erase the memories of those
who use forbidden magic

14:11.225 --> 14:13.394
or those who learn the secret of magic.

14:13.477 --> 14:15.729
They are witches who protect magic.

14:16.230 --> 14:20.234
They follow the rules
without sentiment and without exception.

14:20.734 --> 14:23.112
If we hand her over to people like that,

14:23.737 --> 14:26.657
they'll wipe out even her love for magic.

14:33.664 --> 14:35.416
Coco is a good kid.

14:36.083 --> 14:38.627
She works hard, cares about her mother,

14:38.711 --> 14:40.588
and more than anything, she loves magic.

14:41.589 --> 14:44.341
It's my fault she learned the truth.

14:44.842 --> 14:47.803
If her memories about magic
are to be erased,

14:48.846 --> 14:51.765
then mine should be too.

14:56.353 --> 14:57.271
Damn it!

14:57.813 --> 15:01.066
When you agreed to take them on
as apprentices,

15:01.150 --> 15:04.194
I thought you were finally settling down.

15:05.946 --> 15:07.239
Do what you want.

15:09.491 --> 15:14.121
But if anything happens, I'm reporting you
to the Great Hall immediately.

15:14.204 --> 15:17.625
That's the job of the Watchful Eye.

15:24.173 --> 15:25.758
Master Qifrey.

15:25.841 --> 15:26.884
Don't worry.

15:27.635 --> 15:32.890
You passed the exam using your own magic
and became an official apprentice.

15:33.974 --> 15:35.976
You can hold your head high.

15:40.564 --> 15:41.398
Yes!

15:41.482 --> 15:42.608
Right.

15:44.234 --> 15:47.988
Now then, everyone, go take
a hot bath before you catch a cold.

15:48.072 --> 15:49.406
- Okay!
- Yes!

15:55.329 --> 15:56.997
Brushbuddy?

15:57.998 --> 15:59.792
Brushbuddy?

16:00.709 --> 16:03.045
Where are you, Brushbuddy?

16:06.256 --> 16:08.050
Wait, Brushbuddy, that's...

16:09.635 --> 16:14.306
Oh no! It went in!

16:25.025 --> 16:28.404
“Don't knock. You'll be cursed.”

16:35.703 --> 16:38.956
Um, excuse me.

16:39.665 --> 16:42.459
Brushbuddy, come out.

16:42.960 --> 16:45.254
Let's dry your fur together.

16:49.675 --> 16:50.509
Hey.

16:53.345 --> 16:55.597
It says, "Don't knock."

16:57.349 --> 16:59.977
Meaning, don't come in.

17:06.400 --> 17:08.402
Are you listening, Coco?

17:09.278 --> 17:10.654
I'm sorry.

17:10.738 --> 17:11.739
Huh?

17:11.822 --> 17:14.158
You were soaked. How are you dry now?

17:21.582 --> 17:22.666
It's warm.

17:23.542 --> 17:25.502
My hair is drying too.

17:26.503 --> 17:27.671
Is this

17:28.338 --> 17:30.966
Olruggio's magic?

17:38.140 --> 17:39.767
Thank you very much.

17:40.392 --> 17:42.061
Can't have you getting sick.

17:42.144 --> 17:44.063
I'm the Watchful Eye.

17:44.146 --> 17:46.190
He watches over our health too.

17:46.273 --> 17:49.693
It was my fault.
I forgot to shut the door.

17:49.777 --> 17:51.653
But get out already.

17:51.737 --> 17:53.822
- Don't touch anything--
- Whoa!

17:54.406 --> 17:56.700
I said, don't touch!

17:58.285 --> 18:00.704
This... this magic!

18:02.206 --> 18:05.292
It's the first spell
that made me love magic!

18:05.375 --> 18:07.461
Stones that light up
when you step on them!

18:08.337 --> 18:11.090
The Glowstone Path is my signature work.

18:13.550 --> 18:15.511
The stones are layered.

18:16.136 --> 18:19.515
The weight makes the sigil
and the circle overlap. A simple spell.

18:20.057 --> 18:22.726
You can find this anywhere-- What?!

18:22.810 --> 18:24.186
What the heck are you doing?!

18:24.686 --> 18:26.563
It's glowing.

18:27.773 --> 18:31.318
Well, that's just how the spell works.

18:33.112 --> 18:34.446
For me,

18:34.530 --> 18:37.032
this light is special.

18:41.787 --> 18:43.956
When I walked, the stones would light up.

18:44.456 --> 18:47.376
As if I had magical powers.

18:49.128 --> 18:53.423
Just taking each step felt like sheer joy.

18:55.509 --> 18:57.970
It's a sad memory too.

19:00.806 --> 19:02.057
But even still,

19:05.811 --> 19:08.564
this magic gave me my dream.

19:10.566 --> 19:11.441
So...

19:12.901 --> 19:14.361
thank you,

19:14.862 --> 19:16.196
Master Olruggio.

19:19.408 --> 19:20.242
I...

19:20.868 --> 19:23.745
I'm not a master! Now, scram.

19:34.381 --> 19:38.719
Even her love for magic will be wiped out...

19:47.227 --> 19:49.229
It hasn't stopped raining.

19:50.022 --> 19:50.898
Yes.

19:51.523 --> 19:54.860
Maybe I'll study in the living room today.

19:55.360 --> 19:56.945
Do you want to join me, Agott?

19:57.029 --> 19:58.614
I'll pass.

19:58.697 --> 20:00.824
I can focus better in the room.

20:00.908 --> 20:02.659
Oh, I see...

20:02.743 --> 20:05.370
Then I'll call you when it's lunchtime.

20:28.644 --> 20:29.853
Ugh, come on!

20:30.854 --> 20:32.856
It's noisy, so noisy.

20:32.940 --> 20:34.816
I can't concentrate.

20:38.570 --> 20:39.655
It's fine.

20:39.738 --> 20:42.866
A little noise makes for good practice.

20:56.630 --> 20:59.591
It's still shaky,
but it's more stable than before.

21:00.217 --> 21:03.345
At this rate,
I can do the next trial soon.

21:03.929 --> 21:05.138
Even do actual work!

21:07.474 --> 21:09.476
Okay, once more.

21:12.521 --> 21:14.231
Help! Please!

21:14.314 --> 21:15.983
There are witches here, right?!

21:16.066 --> 21:17.109
Master!

21:17.192 --> 21:18.986
What is all the noise?

21:19.069 --> 21:22.030
I understand the situation.
And the scene there--

21:22.114 --> 21:23.991
Please help us, witch!

21:24.074 --> 21:25.742
- Please!
- Understood.

21:25.826 --> 21:28.495
First, stay calm.
We'll get ready right away.

21:29.454 --> 21:30.664
What's going on?

21:31.206 --> 21:34.501
The rain destroyed the bridge
over the Stairway River.

21:34.584 --> 21:38.046
A carriage is stranded in
the middle of the river.

21:38.130 --> 21:40.382
It's too dangerous
for anyone to get close.

21:41.883 --> 21:42.968
My son

21:43.719 --> 21:45.637
is in that carriage!

21:46.221 --> 21:48.140
Yes, I understand.

21:48.223 --> 21:50.267
- Let's go right away.
- Please!

21:50.350 --> 21:51.393
Real work!

21:51.977 --> 21:53.937
Then I'll go with one other right away--

21:54.021 --> 21:55.022
Master!

21:55.105 --> 21:57.649
Agott, all of you,
it's dangerous so stay here--

21:57.733 --> 22:01.194
No. Please, take me with you.

22:02.112 --> 22:04.031
I know I can help.

22:04.114 --> 22:05.324
I promise!

23:34.079 --> 23:35.914
Subtitle translation by: Emily Noguchi

23:36.873 --> 23:40.919
EPISODE 7: MAGIC FOR SOMEONE
